# Nougat extraction stub — arXiv:2307.05406

*This is a placeholder for a Nougat OCR extraction of the arXiv PDF.*

## Status
Nougat extraction was **not performed** for this replication. The paper was read
directly from the arXiv-hosted PDF; equations and benchmark parameters were
transcribed by hand into the reimplementation (`work/trotter24.py`).

## Why a stub
The QC-100 wave 8-artifact template expects an `extraction/nougat.mmd`. Nougat is
useful when the workflow depends on programmatic equation extraction across a
large corpus; for a single-paper hand-transcribed replication like this one, the
canonical evidence lives in:

- `report/REPORT.md` — full narrative with equations, tables, verdict
- `report/REPORT.tex` — LaTeX form of the same
- `report/evidence/trotter24_results.json` — raw numerical evidence
- `work/trotter24.py`, `work/trotter24_L10.py` — reimplemented code

## Paper (canonical bibliographic data)

- arXiv ID: 2307.05406
- Title: *Measuring Trotter error and its application to precision-guaranteed Hamiltonian simulations*
- Authors: Tatsuhiko N. Ikeda, Hideki Kono, Keisuke Fujii
- Affiliations: RIKEN / U. Tokyo / Osaka U.
- Version referenced: v3, July 2024
