## Key equations transcribed (paraphrased)

- Eq. (8):  η_F(δt) = η_F^(24)(δt) + O(δt^{n+1})
- Eq. (13): Forest-Ruth-Suzuki T4 = T2(sδt) · T2((1−2s)δt) · T2(sδt),  s = 1/(2 − 2^{1/3})
- Eqs. (27–28): 1D mixed-field Ising, A = h_x Σ σ^x, B = Σ (J_z σ^z σ^z + h_z σ^z),  L=18, J_z=−1, h_z=0.2, h_x=−2
- Eq. (29): operator-norm δt_bound involving nested double commutators [A,[A,B]] and [B,[B,A]]
- Adaptive rule: δt_new = C · δt · (ε / η_est)^{1/(m+1)} with m=2, C=0.95

